Free the reversed curves when one reversal fails

BuildRGBOutputMatrixShaper returned without freeing the reversed tone
curves already built when a later cmsReverseToneCurve call failed (for
example on an allocation failure). cmsFreeToneCurveTriple skips null
entries, so it frees exactly the curves that were built.

diff --git a/src/cmsio1.c b/src/cmsio1.c
index 0989826..7b049b3 100644
--- a/src/cmsio1.c
+++ b/src/cmsio1.c
@@ -484,6 +484,7 @@ cmsPipeline* BuildRGBOutputMatrixShaper(cmsHPROFILE hProfile)
     InvShapes[2] = cmsReverseToneCurve(Shapes[2]);
 
     if (!InvShapes[0] || !InvShapes[1] || !InvShapes[2]) {
+        cmsFreeToneCurveTriple(InvShapes);
         return NULL;
     }
 
